# Hook scripts are executable content that runs automatically on every
# contributor's machine (see CVE-2025-59536). Every change to a guardrail, a
# permission rule, or the installer requires security review.
#
# Consumers who install this baseline should add the equivalent rule to their
# own repo:  /.claude/**  @their-security-team
#
# Maintainer. Replace with a security team handle if ownership moves.

/hooks/                     @topazyo
/lib/                       @topazyo
/managed/                   @topazyo
/settings.template.json     @topazyo
/baseline.config.json       @topazyo
/install.sh                 @topazyo
/tests/                     @topazyo
/.github/                   @topazyo
/SECURITY.md                @topazyo
